    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1639">

                <pb facs="1188" n="1072" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1072"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 704.6712.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Morgenthau to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 21, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Ottoman Government desires ascertain promptly if American Government will take
                    charge of Ottoman interests in Mexico and in South American countries where
                    Turkey is not represented.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Ambassador.</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
